            "review_title": "Review at Quan Oc Nhu",
            "review_text": "Richard H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12 contributions\n0\nGreat Shellfish restaurant\nDec 2019 • Couples\nThe best Shellfish restaurant I have ever been to. The place was packed out 15 minutes after we arrived for lunch and there was only one other non-Asian foreigner there besides myself....when the locals rush in then you know you have made the right choice.The menu was comprehensive, the service efficient and friendly, the dishes well presented and tasty and most importantly it was clean.\nOverall a great venue for something different, a bit cramped at the peak of the feeding frenzy but a terrific occasion....try it, you won’t be disappointed.\nRead more\nWritten December 15, 2019",
