            "review_text": "DENIS C\nFontenay-sous-Bois, France1491 contributions\n0\nHidden gem for snails lover\nJul 2019 • Friends\nDifficult to find but worth it , do not expect high class it is like street food but with tables, so many varieties of sea snails in different sauces and preparations , do not forget to bring our own bread to soak the delicious sauces , super reasonable prices Crabs and shrimps also available, due to high turnover everything is super fresh\nWritten July 25, 2019",
