            "review_title": "Review at Quan Oc Nhu",
            "review_text": "Shane T\nSydney, Australia1310 contributions\n0\nGet in early\nMar 2017 • Friends\nMy wife and I met a friend for dinner. All I can say is if you really want traditional Vietnamese food got to a place like this. You must know where your going to find. Down a dark alley off the main road then wow a little hidden alley with a few little local places. I was the only white man there as my wife is Vietnamese and so is our friend. We got there at 6:30pm and by 7:30 most of the popular sea food like prawns had run out. Just goes to show that everyday is pretty much all fresh. My 8:45 when we were leaving they were packing up. \nA must if you can find. Very tasty and I'm not a big seafood lover but I'd definitely go again if I get another chance.\nRead more\nWritten March 23, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
