            "review_text": "danmaio\nPerth, Australia88 contributions\n0\nWorth the visit\nOct 2016 • Friends\nWent for dinner with another couple and really enjoyed it. I think it wasn't the best oc place I had been too, but was still good and much much cheaper than the restaurants closer to Pham Ngu Lao. The crab claws in tamarind while had a great taste, the crab was over cooked, which seems the norm in theses places. The clams in lemongrass was the standout. Don't forget to bring a few banh mi to soak up all the sauces. Total cost was 800000 vnd for 4 people , so great price. It's down a laneway off Dien Bien Hue street.\nRead more\nWritten October 23, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
