            "review_text": "Daniel Do\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam149 contributions\n0\nComfortable & Air Conditioned; Average taste\nMay 2016\nI decided to come here after reading alot of reviews of this place. Many great Oc places dont get attention on here due to the scale of the restaurant; either they are too small business oriented or lack any marketing awareness. Result of this place... average better ones out there\n\nGood:\n-Air conditioned\n-Clean (they have trash cans by each table)\n\nOpportunities:\n-Oc selection was very minimal. i called 3 different dishes and all were not available\n-The servings per dish are smaller than other places\n-Because the seats are inside a home, the echo of all the people talking just stay in the room making it very hard to have a conversation with your friends.. too hard to hear\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 23, 2016",
