            "review_text": "Huongle\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam262 contributions\n0\nThe best place for snails and crab\nNov 2015 • Friends\nThis restaurant is special for its dishes of crab, shrimp and snails, almost 30 different kinds of snails, everything is fresh and tasty and cheap. Located in a small alley but easy to find and always crowded, sometimes have to book a table in advance. Opening time about 11am till 8pm. Services slowly sometimes but acceptable! \nIf you dare to try this is the best choice in city.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 15, 2015",
